---
layout: ds-layout.njk
title: Design Tokens
description: 由 design-tokens/ 自動產生的 Material Design 3 token。設計師在 Figma 修改後匯出 JSON 即可同步。
page:
  id: tokens
permalink: tokens/index.html
---
{% from "ds-sync.njk" import renderTokenSync %}

{{ renderTokenSync() }}

<section class="ds-section" id="colors-fandor">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">FANDOR 品牌色</h2>
  <p class="ds-section__desc">原始 palette，語意色會引用這些值。</p>
  <div class="ds-swatch-grid">
    {% for token in tokens.fandor %}
    <div class="ds-swatch">
      <div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background: var(--{{ token.name }})"></div>
      <div class="ds-swatch__meta">
        <code class="ds-swatch__name">--{{ token.name }}</code>
        <span class="ds-swatch__value">{{ token.value }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="colors-semantic">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">MD3 語意色</h2>
  <div class="ds-swatch-grid">
    {% for token in tokens.semantic %}
    <div class="ds-swatch">
      <div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background: var(--{{ token.name }})"></div>
      <div class="ds-swatch__meta">
        <code class="ds-swatch__name">--{{ token.name }}</code>
        <span class="ds-swatch__value">{{ token.value }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="typography">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Typography</h2>
  <div class="ds-type-list">
    {% for token in tokens.typography %}
    <div class="ds-type-row">
      <div class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font: var(--{{ token.name }})">
        創作者銷售平台 FANDOR
      </div>
      <div class="ds-type-row__meta">
        <code>--{{ token.name }}</code>
        <span>{{ token.value }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="shape">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Shape（圓角）</h2>
  <div class="ds-shape-grid">
    {% for token in tokens.shape %}
    <div class="ds-shape">
      <div class="ds-shape__box" style="border-radius: var(--{{ token.name }})"></div>
      <code>--{{ token.name }}</code>
      <span>{{ token.value }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="spacing">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Spacing & Layout</h2>
  <div class="ds-spacing-list">
    {% for token in tokens.layout %}
    <div class="ds-spacing-row">
      <code>--{{ token.name }}</code>
      {% if 'spacing' in token.name %}
      <div class="ds-spacing-row__bar" style="width: var(--{{ token.name }})"></div>
      {% endif %}
      <span>{{ token.value }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="motion">
  <h2 class="ds-section__title">Motion</h2>
  <ul class="ds-token-list">
    {% for token in tokens.motion %}
    <li>
      <code>--{{ token.name }}</code>
      <span>{{ token.value }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
